  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"602\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"171\">Scent Life</strong> is a new Australian fragrance house dedicated to capturing moments, moods, and memories through uniquely crafted perfumes. Rooted in 20 years of perfumery expertise, each blend is designed and bottled in Australia using globally sourced ingredients — with a focus on purity, emotion, and artistry. Inspired by nature, ritual, and the sensory beauty of everyday life, Scent Life brings a personal and modern touch to luxury fragrance.</p><hr data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"607\"><h3 data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"639\"><strong data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"637\">Product Description:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"1052\">Scent Life offers a curated collection of eau de parfums that blend classic perfumery techniques with contemporary, nature-inspired notes. The current range draws inspiration from tea, botanicals, and Australian landscapes, creating scents that are layered, grounded, and distinctly wearable. Each perfume is hand-filled in small batches, with attention to detail from the first spray to the last lingering note.</p><hr data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1057\"><h3 data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1096\"><strong data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1094\">USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1484\">Scent Life stands out for its <strong data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1169\">Australian-made, tea-inspired perfumes</strong>, crafted with over two decades of perfumery knowledge. The brand blends <strong data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1267\">artisan craftsmanship</strong> with a <strong data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1305\">minimal, refined aesthetic</strong>, offering a sensorial experience that’s both elevated and grounded in nature. All products are <strong data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1423\">ethically produced</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1440\">small batch</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1483\">exclusively designed in Australia</strong>.</p></div></div>",
